      "page": 1,
      "source": "Addressing the sim-to-real challenge requires two complementary strategies. The first is to reduce the gap by improving simulator fidelity and calibrating unknown parameters. The second is to strengthen the policy so that it can tolerate residual discrepancies, providing robustness to environmental variations and the ability for online adaptation. In the remainder of this chapter, we organize these strategies into three levers: pretraining alignment, robustness training, and post-deployment adaptation.",
